{"4277880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GLOAM: Search Company", "steam_appid": 4277880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> The content on this page reflects the current state of development (<strong>&quot;Work in Progress&quot;</strong>). Visual elements, gameplay mechanics, and technical specifications are subject to change until release to ensure the best possible final experience for the public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277880/extras/e466ed45075a6768b31db44bef80b708.avif?t=1768229766\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLOAM: Search Company</strong> is a cooperative horror game for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue survivors, collect and manage resources, and extract everything you can to invest in upgrades and keep your agency running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A microphone is highly recommended to play <strong>GLOAM: Search Company</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is key. Working together, you and your friends can plan the best strategy to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a more immersive experience, we recommend using headphones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277880/extras/e466ed45075a6768b31db44bef80b708.avif?t=1768229766\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The forest is not empty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As members of a rescue agency,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your job is to locate, protect, and extract</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survivors lost in the haunted forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277880/extras/e466ed45075a6768b31db44bef80b708.avif?t=1768229766\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is not just a rescue mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of an agency that enters places no one else dares to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything wants to be found but it’s up to you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277880/extras/e466ed45075a6768b31db44bef80b708.avif?t=1768229766\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep your agency running</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescues are not free. Fees must be paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better equipment helps and the forest won’t wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> The content on this page reflects the current state of development (<strong>&quot;Work in Progress&quot;</strong>). Visual elements, gameplay mechanics, and technical specifications are subject to change until release to ensure the best possible final experience for the public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277880/extras/e466ed45075a6768b31db44bef80b708.avif?t=1768229766\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLOAM: Search Company</strong> is a cooperative horror game for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue survivors, collect and manage resources, and extract everything you can to invest in upgrades and keep your agency running.</p><p c